"For entering into a hardware EQ, e.g. the parametric EQ of an RME ADI-2 (set Filters to 5)" = "方便输入到硬件 EQ，比如 RME ADI-2 的参数 EQ（把滤波器数设为 5）";
"Left" = "左";
"Level looks good." = "电平合适。";
"Load File…" = "载入文件…";
"Max boost" = "最大提升";
"Measure" = "测量";
"Measure at least once to see the room response here." = "至少测量一次，这里就会显示房间的频响。";
"Measure your speakers where you sit, fix what the setup can fix, and correct the room's bass resonances. The rest of the sound is left to your speakers." = "在你平时坐的位置测量音箱，先解决摆位和设置能解决的问题，再校正房间造成的低频驻波，其余部分交给音箱本身。";
"Measured" = "实测";
"Measured. Move the microphone a little and measure again to average several positions." = "测量完成。把麦克风稍微挪动一下再测一次，可以对多个位置取平均。";
"Measurements play at the current output volume. Start low." = "测量会按当前输出音量播放，请先从小音量开始。";
"No calibration data found in that file." = "这个文件里没有找到校准数据。";
"None" = "无";
"Pause music and keep the room quiet while measuring." = "测量时请暂停音乐，保持房间安静。";
"Plays pink noise for three seconds. Aim for peaks between −30 and −10 dB on the microphone." = "会播放三秒粉红噪声。让麦克风的峰值落在 −30 到 −10 dB 之间。";
"Remove" = "移除";
"Right" = "右";
"Room" = "房间校正";
"Room Correction" = "房间校正";
"Room curve" = "房间曲线";
"Room measurement" = "房间测量";
"Room · %@" = "房间 · %@";
"SNR %.0f dB · peak %.0f dB" = "信噪比 %.0f dB · 峰值 %.0f dB";
"Speakers" = "音箱";
"Tapline needs microphone access to measure your speakers." = "Tapline 需要麦克风权限才能测量音箱。";
"The measurement failed. Check that the microphone hears the speakers." = "测量失败。请确认麦克风能收到音箱的声音。";
"The microphone clipped during the sweep. Lower the volume and measure again." = "扫频时麦克风削波了。调低音量后再测一次。";
"The room is noisy or the level is low. The result may be unreliable." = "房间太吵或电平太低，结果可能不可靠。";
"The selected input has no channels." = "所选输入设备没有可用声道。";
"Too loud: the microphone is close to clipping. Turn the volume or the preamp gain down." = "太响了：麦克风快要削波。请调低音量或话放增益。";
"Too quiet. Turn the volume up, raise the preamp gain, or check the microphone channel and phantom power." = "太小声了。请调大音量、提高话放增益，或检查麦克风声道和幻象电源。";
"Use a measurement or studio condenser microphone at ear height, pointing between the speakers. A calibration file improves accuracy." = "使用测量麦克风或录音棚电容麦，放在耳朵高度，指向两只音箱中间。有校准文件会更准确。";

/* Room correction: stereo measurement, setup check, ADI-2 */
"Left & right" = "左右分别";
"Switch off any EQ, Bass/Treble or Loudness in the DAC (such as the RME ADI-2) while measuring, so Tapline sees the speakers as they are." = "测量时关掉解码器（如 RME ADI-2）里的 EQ、低音/高音和响度补偿，让 Tapline 测到音箱本来的样子。";
"Left & right: an 8-second sweep on each speaker, then three short clicks for timing (about 22 seconds). Needed for balance, distance and polarity checks, and for correcting each speaker separately." = "左右分别：每只音箱各播放 8 秒扫频，最后三声短音用来测时间（共约 22 秒）。检查左右平衡、距离和极性，以及左右分别校正，都需要这种测量。";
"One 8-second sweep on the chosen speakers." = "在所选音箱上播放一次 8 秒扫频。";
"R − L %+.2f ms" = "右 − 左 %+.2f ms";
"3. Check the Setup" = "3. 检查摆位与设置";
"Fix these at the speakers first: the EQ then has less to do and works better." = "先在音箱这边解决这些问题：EQ 要做的更少，效果也更好。";
"Nothing to fix at the speakers. The setup looks good." = "音箱这边没有需要调整的，摆位和设置都不错。";
"Measure to see suggestions for balance, speaker distance, polarity, subwoofer level and the speakers' room switches." = "测量后，这里会给出左右平衡、音箱距离、极性、超低音音量和音箱背板开关的建议。";
"Run on" = "运行于";
"Correct left and right separately" = "左右分别校正";
"Needs a left & right measurement. On the ADI-2 this uses Dual EQ." = "需要“左右分别”的测量。在 ADI-2 上会使用 Dual EQ。";
"Fits the ADI-2's own parametric EQ: five bands per channel (bands 4 and 5 from 200 Hz), 0.5 dB steps. The DAC then corrects every source, not only this Mac." = "按 ADI-2 自带的参数 EQ 来拟合：每声道 5 段（第 4、5 段从 200 Hz 起），步进 0.5 dB。之后由解码器校正所有音源，不只是这台 Mac。";
"Tapline corrects what this Mac plays, on the current output." = "由 Tapline 在当前输出上校正这台 Mac 播放的声音。";
"5 per channel (ADI-2)" = "每声道 5 段（ADI-2）";
"Export for ADI-2 Remote…" = "导出到 ADI-2 Remote…";
"Preview in Tapline" = "在 Tapline 中试听";
"Listen to the same correction through Tapline before loading it into the ADI-2" = "载入 ADI-2 之前，先用 Tapline 试听同样的校正";
"Copied." = "已复制。";
"Load the correction either into the ADI-2 or in Tapline, not both, or the room is corrected twice." = "校正只放在 ADI-2 或 Tapline 其中一处，不要两边同时开，否则会校正两次。";
"Applied to %@. Measurements bypass Tapline, so measuring again still shows the room without this EQ." = "已应用到 %@。测量信号不经过 Tapline，所以再次测量看到的仍是没有这个 EQ 的房间响应。";
"Room correction" = "房间校正";
"Balanced in Tapline. Measurements bypass Tapline, so this stays listed." = "已在 Tapline 中调好平衡。测量信号不经过 Tapline，所以这条会一直显示。";
"Set Balance in Tapline" = "在 Tapline 中设置平衡";
"left" = "左";
"right" = "右";
"Left and right have opposite polarity" = "左右音箱极性相反";
"The measurement is noisy (SNR %.0f dB)" = "测量噪声较大（信噪比 %.0f dB）";
"The %@ speaker is %.1f dB louder" = "%@音箱响 %.1f dB";
"The %@ speaker is %.0f cm farther away" = "%@音箱远 %.0f 厘米";
"Left and right differ by up to %.0f dB around %@" = "左右在 %2$@ 附近最多相差 %1$.0f dB";
"Too much deep bass (%+.1f dB below 90 Hz)" = "超低频过多（90 Hz 以下 %+.1f dB）";
"Too little deep bass (%+.1f dB below 90 Hz)" = "超低频不足（90 Hz 以下 %+.1f dB）";
"Boomy lower bass (%+.1f dB from 100 to 400 Hz)" = "中低频发轰（100–400 Hz %+.1f dB）";
"Desk bounce around %@ (%+.1f dB)" = "%@ 附近有桌面反射（%+.1f dB）";
"Room resonance at %@ (%+.1f dB)" = "%@ 房间共振（%+.1f dB）";
"Deep dip at %@ (−%.0f dB)" = "%@ 深凹陷（−%.0f dB）";
"Bright treble (%+.1f dB above 4 kHz)" = "高频偏亮（4 kHz 以上 %+.1f dB）";
"Dull treble (%+.1f dB above 4 kHz)" = "高频偏暗（4 kHz 以上 %+.1f dB）";
"Only %d measurement position(s)" = "只测了 %d 个位置";
"One speaker moves out while the other moves in, which thins the bass and blurs the centre. Check the cable wiring (XLR pins 2 and 3) and any polarity or phase switch, then measure again." = "一只音箱的振膜向外推时，另一只在向内收，低频会变薄，中央声像也会模糊。检查线材接法（XLR 的 2、3 脚）和音箱上的极性/相位开关，然后重新测量。";
"Turn the volume up a little, close windows and switch off fans, then measure again." = "把音量稍微调大，关上窗户、关掉风扇，然后重新测量。";
"Turn that speaker down by %.1f dB with its level control, or set the balance in the DAC (on the RME ADI-2: VOL screen, Balance)." = "用这只音箱的音量（输入灵敏度）旋钮把它调低 %.1f dB，或者在解码器里调平衡（RME ADI-2：VOL 界面里的 Balance）。";
"Move the %@ speaker about %.0f cm closer, or the other one back, so both reach you at the same time. The centre image gets sharper." = "把%@音箱往你这边挪近约 %.0f 厘米（或把另一只往后挪），让两只音箱的声音同时到达，中央声像会更清晰。";
"Normal near walls and corners. Correcting left and right separately takes care of it." = "音箱靠墙或靠近墙角时很常见，左右分别校正就能处理。";
"Turn the subwoofer level down by about %.0f dB before correcting, so the EQ has less to cut." = "校正前先把超低音音量调低约 %.0f dB，EQ 需要削减的就更少。";
"Turn the subwoofer level up by about %.0f dB. Without a subwoofer this is where the speakers run out." = "把超低音音量调高约 %.0f dB。如果没有超低音，这就是音箱本身的下潜极限。";
"Typical of speakers close to a wall. On Genelec monitors set the Bass Tilt switches to %.0f dB; other speakers have a similar bass or boundary switch." = "音箱离墙太近时的典型表现。真力音箱把背板的 Bass Tilt 开关设为 %.0f dB；其他音箱一般也有类似的低频或边界补偿开关。";
"Sound bouncing off the desk or console adds a bump. On Genelec monitors switch on Desktop Control (−4 dB at 160 Hz). Stands, or moving the speakers to the front edge, also help." = "声音被桌面或调音台反射会形成一个鼓包。真力音箱打开背板的 Desktop Control（160 Hz −4 dB）；换用脚架，或把音箱挪到桌子前沿，也有帮助。";
"Fits a room dimension of about %.1f m. The correction cuts it." = "对应约 %.1f 米的房间尺寸。校正会把它削掉。";
"Near the subwoofer crossover this is often the subwoofer and the speakers cancelling. Try the subwoofer's phase switch or another subwoofer position, then measure again. EQ cannot fill it." = "在超低音分频点附近，这通常是超低音和主音箱互相抵消。试试超低音的相位开关，或换个摆放位置，然后重新测量。EQ 补不平这种凹陷。";
"A reflection cancelling the direct sound, for example from a wall about %.0f cm behind the speakers or behind you. EQ cannot fill it: move the speakers or your seat by 20 to 30 cm and measure again." = "这是反射声抵消了直达声，例如来自音箱后面或你身后约 %.0f 厘米处的墙。EQ 补不平：把音箱或座位挪动 20–30 厘米后重新测量。";
"If it also sounds that way, set the speakers' Treble Tilt to %+.0f dB." = "如果听感也是这样，把音箱的 Treble Tilt 设为 %+.0f dB。";
"Without a calibration file this may be the microphone." = "没有校准文件时，这也可能是麦克风本身的特性。";
"Measure 3 to 5 positions within about 30 cm of your head for a more reliable correction." = "在头部周围约 30 厘米范围内测 3–5 个位置，校正会更可靠。";
"The ADI-2 has five bells per channel, and bands 4 and 5 only work from 200 Hz up with Q up to 5. Use fewer bands, or fit the room correction for the ADI-2." = "ADI-2 每声道只有 5 段钟形滤波器，第 4、5 段只能用在 200 Hz 以上，Q 最大 5。请减少频段，或在房间校正里选择按 ADI-2 拟合。";
"The ADI-2 takes bells, one low shelf (as Bass, 20–150 Hz) and one high shelf (as Treble, 3–10 kHz). Change or remove the other filters." = "ADI-2 只接受钟形滤波器、一个低搁架（作为 Bass，20–150 Hz）和一个高搁架（作为 Treble，3–10 kHz）。请修改或删除其他滤波器。";
"That is not an ADI-2 EQ preset." = "这不是 ADI-2 的 EQ 预设文件。";
"In ADI-2 Remote, open EQ Presets, click File – Load and pick the file, then Store it to the unit." = "在 ADI-2 Remote 里打开 EQ Presets，点 File – Load 选中这个文件，再点 Store 存进设备。";
"Export for RME ADI-2…" = "导出给 RME ADI-2…";
"Saves an .adieqpr preset for RME's ADI-2 Remote app, so the ADI-2 DAC runs this EQ itself" = "保存为 RME ADI-2 Remote 使用的 .adieqpr 预设，让 ADI-2 DAC 自己运行这个 EQ";
"Channels" = "声道";
"L + R" = "左 + 右";
"Which speaker or earpiece this band applies to" = "这个频段作用于哪一侧音箱或耳机";

/* Room correction: correction limit up to 20 kHz */
"Above 2 kHz the EQ also corrects the speakers themselves (crossover, tweeter). Measure several positions, preferably with a calibration file. If the treble ends up too bright, choose Room curve or lower the Tilt." = "超过 2 kHz 时，EQ 也会修正音箱本身（分频点、高音单元）。请多测几个位置，最好使用校准文件。如果校正后高频太亮，选择“房间曲线”或调低“倾斜”。";

/* Room correction: measuring guide */
"%lld of %lld positions measured" = "已测 %1$lld / %2$lld 个位置";
"All positions measured. The correction below uses their average." = "所有位置都测完了。下面的校正使用它们的平均值。";
"Put the microphone where your head is when you listen, at ear height, then click Measure." = "把麦克风放在你平时听音时头部所在的位置、耳朵的高度，然后点“测量”。";
"Next: about 20 cm to the left of your listening spot." = "下一个：听音位置左侧约 20 厘米处。";
"Next: about 20 cm to the right of your listening spot." = "下一个：听音位置右侧约 20 厘米处。";
"Next: about 20 cm in front of your listening spot, towards the speakers." = "下一个：听音位置前方约 20 厘米处（朝音箱方向）。";
"Next: about 20 cm behind your listening spot." = "下一个：听音位置后方约 20 厘米处。";
"Enough to correct already; more positions make it steadier." = "已经足够校正了；多测几个位置会更稳定。";
"Microphone positions" = "麦克风位置";
"%lld s left" = "还剩 %lld 秒";
"Left speaker" = "左音箱";
"Right speaker" = "右音箱";
"Both speakers" = "两只音箱";
"Timing clicks" = "测时短音";
"Good" = "良好";
"Fair" = "一般";
"Measure again" = "建议重测";
"Differs" = "偏差大";
"A clean measurement." = "测量很干净。";
"Usable. A little more volume or a quieter room gives a cleaner measurement." = "可以用。音量稍大一点或房间再安静一点，测量会更干净。";
"Clearly unlike the other positions: a noise during the sweep, or a bumped or turned microphone? If in doubt, delete it and measure that spot again." = "和其他位置明显不同：扫频时有杂音，还是麦克风被碰到或转了方向？拿不准就删掉它，在那个位置重测一次。";
"Spread" = "离散度";
"One standard deviation between the measured positions. Where it is wide, the response changes from spot to spot and the average is less certain." = "各测量位置之间的一个标准差。越宽，说明频响随位置变化越大，平均值也越不可靠。";
"Positions" = "各位置";
"Show the curve of each measured position" = "显示每个测量位置的曲线";
"%@ is a virtual output. If it belongs to software that changes the sound (such as SoundID Reference or an EQ app), that change ends up in the measurement: switch it off, or make the speakers' own device the output." = "%@ 是虚拟输出设备。如果它属于会改变声音的软件（比如 SoundID Reference 或 EQ 类 App），这些处理会混进测量结果：请先关掉它，或把音箱本身的设备设为输出。";
"%@ is a virtual input, not a microphone. Choose the microphone's own device as the input." = "%@ 是虚拟输入设备，不是麦克风。请把麦克风本身的设备选为输入。";

/* Level-matched bypass, correction strength */
"EQ Bypass" = "EQ 旁通";
"What you hear when the EQ is switched off (EQ switch, ⌘B, ⌃⌥⌘B, menu bar)." = "关掉 EQ 时听到的声音（EQ 开关、⌘B、⌃⌥⌘B、菜单栏）。";
"Match loudness when bypassing" = "旁通时匹配响度";
"A correction usually lowers the level a few dB to make room for its boosts, so without it the music plays louder, and louder tends to sound better. With this on, the bypassed sound plays at the loudness of the EQ (measured on pink noise, like a LUFS meter), so the comparison is fair. It never raises the level." = "校正曲线通常会把音量降低几 dB，给提升的频段留出余量，所以关掉 EQ 后音乐会变响，而更响的声音往往听起来更好。打开这一项后，旁通的声音会以 EQ 的响度播放（用粉红噪声测量，算法同 LUFS 响度表），对比才公平。它不会提高音量。";
"Level-matched %@" = "已匹配响度 %@";
"The EQ is bypassed and the original sound plays at the loudness of the EQ, so you compare sound, not level. You can turn this off in Settings." = "EQ 已旁通，原声以 EQ 的响度播放，让你比较的是音色而不是音量。可以在设置中关闭。";
"Strength" = "强度";
"How much of the correction to apply. At full strength the EQ corrects all the way to the target; lower values go part of the way, like a dry/wet control." = "校正的程度。强度拉满时 EQ 完全校正到目标曲线；调低则只校正一部分，类似干/湿比控制。";

/* Virtual Speakers */
"Virtual Speakers" = "虚拟音箱";
"Puts the sound in front of you, like a pair of speakers at ±30°, with binaural impulse responses. For headphones; replaces crossfeed." = "用双耳脉冲响应把声音放到你面前，像一对摆在 ±30° 的音箱。用于耳机；会取代交叉馈送。";
"Built in" = "内置";
"Imported" = "已导入";
"Import…" = "导入…";
"A HeSuVi or Impulcifer WAV file, a 4-channel file, or two stereo files (one per speaker)" = "HeSuVi 或 Impulcifer 的 WAV 文件、4 声道文件，或两个立体声文件（每只音箱一个）";
"Remove “%@”" = "移除“%@”";
"Where to find HRIR files" = "去哪里找 HRIR 文件";
"Studio room (KU100)" = "录音室房间（KU100）";
"Anechoic (KU100)" = "消声室（KU100）";
"Imported speakers" = "导入的音箱";
"Neumann KU100 dummy head from the SADIE II database, with the reflections of a treated studio room. Bass and lower mids stay dry." = "来自 SADIE II 数据库的 Neumann KU100 人工头，带一间做过声学处理的录音室的反射声。低频和中低频保持干声。";
"Neumann KU100 dummy head from the SADIE II database, anechoic: the speakers without a room. The cleanest sound, but it may seem closer to your head." = "来自 SADIE II 数据库的 Neumann KU100 人工头，消声室：只有音箱、没有房间。声音最干净，但可能听起来离头更近。";
"HeSuVi, 14 channels" = "HeSuVi，14 声道";
"HeSuVi, 7 channels" = "HeSuVi，7 声道";
"Impulcifer hrir.wav" = "Impulcifer hrir.wav";
"4 channels" = "4 声道";
"Two stereo files" = "两个立体声文件";
"One speaker, mirrored" = "单只音箱，左右镜像";
"Choose a HeSuVi or Impulcifer file, or two stereo files (one per speaker)." = "选择一个 HeSuVi 或 Impulcifer 文件，或两个立体声文件（每只音箱一个）。";
"Could not load %@: %@" = "无法加载 %1$@：%2$@";
"That file has %lld channels. Tapline reads HeSuVi files (7 or 14 channels), Impulcifer's hrir.wav (16), 4-channel files, or stereo files of one speaker each." = "这个文件有 %lld 个声道。Tapline 能读取 HeSuVi 文件（7 或 14 声道）、Impulcifer 的 hrir.wav（16 声道）、4 声道文件，或每只音箱一个的立体声文件。";
"The front speakers in that file are silent." = "这个文件里的前置音箱是静音的。";
"Both files are the same speaker. Choose one file for the left speaker and one for the right." = "两个文件是同一侧的音箱。请为左音箱和右音箱各选一个文件。";
"The two files have different sample rates." = "两个文件的采样率不同。";
"Choose one file, or two stereo files (one per speaker)." = "请选择一个文件，或两个立体声文件（每只音箱一个）。";
"That is not a WAV file Tapline can read (PCM or 32/64-bit float)." = "这不是 Tapline 能读取的 WAV 文件（需要 PCM 或 32/64 位浮点）。";

/* Listen As (device simulation) */
"Listen As" = "模拟试听";
"Listen as" = "模拟试听";
"Listen as %@" = "模拟：%@";
"Hear how your music would sound on other headphones, earbuds and speakers, through your own headphones. Your EQ and correction stay as they are, and switching is level-matched." = "用你自己的耳机，听听音乐在其他耳机、耳塞和扬声器上会是什么样。你的 EQ 和校正保持不变，切换时响度一致。";
"Headphones & earbuds" = "耳机与耳塞";
"Speakers in devices" = "设备扬声器";
"Device type" = "设备类型";
"Choose a device below." = "在下方选择一个设备。";
"Global shortcut: switches the simulation on or off from any app" = "全局快捷键：在任何应用中开关模拟";
"With the limiter off, the simulation plays %.1f dB below the loudness of your sound so that it cannot clip. Switch the limiter on (Effects) for an exact level match." = "限幅器关闭时，模拟会比你原本的响度低 %.1f dB，以免削波。打开限幅器（效果页）即可精确匹配响度。";
"Approximations of typical devices, written from general knowledge of how such speakers behave: small drivers lose the bass, small boxes resonate, a car cabin lifts the bass. They are not measurements of any product." = "典型设备的近似模拟，依据这类扬声器的一般特性编写：小单元缺低频，小箱体有共振，车厢会抬高低频。它们不是任何产品的实测数据。";
"Click to stop listening" = "点按停止模拟";
"Click to listen as this device" = "点按模拟这个设备";
"Measurements from squig.link. Tapline fits an EQ that turns the sound your headphone correction aims at into the sound of the device you pick." = "测量数据来自 squig.link。Tapline 会拟合一条 EQ，把你的耳机校正所追求的声音变成你所选设备的声音。";
"Device, e.g. AirPods Pro 2, Apple EarPods, Galaxy Buds" = "设备型号，例如 AirPods Pro 2、Apple EarPods、Galaxy Buds";
"• Correct your own headphones first (Headphone Correction above): the simulation starts from the target that correction aims at." = "• 先校正你自己的耳机（上方的耳机校正）：模拟以该校正所追求的目标曲线为起点。";
"• Pick the mode people actually use, e.g. noise cancelling on." = "• 选择人们实际使用的模式，例如开启降噪。";
"• Above 10 kHz only the broad trend is simulated, because measurement rigs disagree up there." = "• 10 kHz 以上只模拟大致趋势，因为不同测量设备在那里差异很大。";
"Compared with" = "对比目标";
"Your sound" = "你的声音";
"Device" = "设备";
"Simulated" = "模拟结果";
"Stop Listening" = "停止模拟";
"Listen as This Device" = "模拟这个设备";
"Same database as your headphone correction, so Tapline uses the raw difference between this measurement and your target." = "与你的耳机校正来自同一数据库，因此 Tapline 直接使用这份测量与你的目标曲线之间的差异。";
"Measured on another rig than your headphones: Tapline compares it with %@'s own %@ target, so the two rigs' differences cancel." = "与你的耳机不是同一套测量设备：Tapline 将它与 %1$@ 自己的 %2$@ 目标曲线对比，两套设备的差异因此相互抵消。";
"Tapline compares this measurement with %@'s own %@ target, so the rig's colouring cancels. Most accurate when your headphones are corrected to the same kind of target." = "Tapline 将这份测量与 %1$@ 自己的 %2$@ 目标曲线对比，测量设备本身的染色因此抵消。你的耳机校正到同类目标曲线时最准确。";
"Phone speaker" = "手机扬声器";
"Laptop speakers" = "笔记本电脑扬声器";
"TV speakers" = "电视扬声器";
"Small Bluetooth speaker" = "小型蓝牙音箱";
"Car" = "汽车";
"Narrow stereo" = "窄立体声";
"Narrower stereo" = "略窄的立体声";
"Approximation · %@" = "近似模拟 · %@";
"Choose a device in Assistant" = "在“辅助调音”页选择设备";
"Listen As Another Device" = "模拟其他设备";
"Stop Listening As Another Device" = "停止模拟其他设备";
"Listen as another device (Assistant → Listen As)" = "模拟其他设备（辅助调音 → 模拟试听）";

/* Filter phase (linear-phase EQ) */
"Filter Phase" = "滤波器相位";
"Minimum phase" = "最小相位";
"Linear phase" = "线性相位";
"Minimum Phase (no latency)" = "最小相位（无延迟）";
"Linear Phase · Low Latency (%lld ms)" = "线性相位 · 低延迟（%lld ms）";
"Linear phase plays on stereo outputs only, so this %@ speaker layout keeps minimum phase." = "线性相位只用于立体声输出，所以这套 %@ 音箱布局保持最小相位。";
"Linear Phase · High Precision (%lld ms)" = "线性相位 · 高精度（%lld ms）";
"Low latency · %lld ms" = "低延迟 · %lld ms";
"High precision · %lld ms" = "高精度 · %lld ms";
"Linear phase · %lld ms" = "线性相位 · %lld ms";
"The EQ plays in linear phase: the same curve without phase shift, but the sound comes %lld ms late and video may lose lip sync. Switch it in the More menu or in Settings." = "EQ 正以线性相位播放：曲线不变、没有相移，但声音会晚 %lld ms，视频可能音画不同步。可在“更多”菜单或设置中切换。";
"How the EQ treats phase. Set for each output device; also in the Equalizer's More menu." = "EQ 如何处理相位。每个输出设备单独设置；均衡器页的“更多”菜单里也可以切换。";
"For %@" = "当前设备：%@";
"Minimum phase plays without latency. Like an analog EQ, each band shifts the phase a little around its frequency." = "最小相位没有延迟。和模拟 EQ 一样，每个频段会让它附近频率的相位略有偏移。";
"Linear phase plays the same curve without any phase shift, but later: video may lose lip sync. Low latency keeps headphone and speaker corrections exact; high precision also resolves narrow bass bands below 45 Hz. The room correction's timing is unchanged, as linear phase only removes the EQ's own phase shift, and room measurements are not delayed." = "线性相位播放同一条曲线，完全没有相移，但声音会晚一些：视频可能音画不同步。低延迟足以准确还原耳机和音箱校正；高精度还能还原 45 Hz 以下的窄频段。房间校正的时间特性不变：线性相位只去掉 EQ 自身的相移，房间测量也不会被延迟。";

