/* Multichannel speakers: Room page */
"With an AV receiver, switch off its own room correction (Audyssey, Dirac Live, YPAO) while measuring, and use either it or Tapline, not both." = "如果用 AV 功放，测量时请关掉它自带的房间校正（Audyssey、Dirac Live、YPAO），之后二选一：用功放的或用 Tapline 的，不要同时用。";
"2. Speakers" = "2. 音箱";
"Tapline measures and corrects each speaker of this layout. Check first that every speaker plays from its place." = "Tapline 会逐只测量并校正这套布局里的每只音箱。请先确认每只音箱都在正确的位置发声。";
"%d speakers on %d channels. Click a speaker to hear it." = "%d 只音箱，共 %d 个声道。点一只音箱可以单独试听。";
"macOS renders surround and Dolby Atmos (such as Apple Music's) to the layout set in Audio MIDI Setup › Configure Speakers; Tapline reads the same layout. A Dolby bitstream passed through to a receiver cannot be processed." = "macOS 会按“音频 MIDI 设置 › 配置扬声器”里设定的布局渲染环绕声和杜比全景声（例如 Apple Music 的）；Tapline 读取的也是这个布局。直通给功放的杜比码流无法处理。";
"Playing: %@ (%d of %d). Does the noise come from that speaker?" = "正在播放：%@（第 %d 只，共 %d 只）。噪声是从这只音箱发出的吗？";
"Yes" = "是";
"No" = "否";
"Play Again" = "再播一次";
"Stop" = "停止";
"Check Wiring" = "检查接线";
"Plays pink noise on each speaker in turn and asks where you hear it." = "依次在每只音箱上播放粉红噪声，并问你声音从哪里来。";
"Every speaker plays from its place." = "每只音箱都在正确的位置发声。";
"Not from its place: %@. Check the speaker cables, the receiver's speaker setup and the layout in Audio MIDI Setup, then check again." = "位置不对：%@。请检查音箱线、功放的音箱设置以及“音频 MIDI 设置”里的布局，然后再检查一次。";
"3. Measure" = "3. 测量";
"Measure All Speakers" = "测量所有音箱";
"%@ (%d of %d)" = "%@（第 %d 只，共 %d 只）";
"Each speaker plays a %.0f-second sweep in turn, then a short click for timing: about %.0f seconds per position. The subwoofer's click is a low rumble." = "每只音箱依次播放 %.0f 秒扫频，最后各一声短音用来测时间：每个位置约 %.0f 秒。超低音的短音是一声低沉的轰鸣。";
"4. Levels, Distances and Polarity" = "4. 音量、距离与极性";
"Compared with the front left speaker. Tapline turns the louder speakers down to the quietest and holds back the nearer ones until the farthest arrives." = "以前左音箱为参照。Tapline 会把较响的音箱调低到与最轻的一样，并让较近的音箱延时，等最远的声音一起到达。";
"Measure to see each speaker's level, distance and polarity." = "测量后，这里会显示每只音箱的音量、距离和极性。";
"Bass management and crossovers stay the receiver's job: set the speakers to Small or Large and the crossover there. Tapline leaves the subwoofer's level to its own gain or the receiver." = "低音管理和分频仍由功放负责：音箱的大/小设置和分频点请在功放里设定。超低音的音量由它自己的增益旋钮或功放来调，Tapline 不动。";
"Switch off the receiver's own room correction (Audyssey, Dirac Live, YPAO) while measuring, and then use either it or Tapline, not both." = "测量时请关掉功放自带的房间校正（Audyssey、Dirac Live、YPAO），之后二选一：用它或用 Tapline，不要同时用。";
"Speaker" = "音箱";
"Level" = "音量";
"Distance" = "距离";
"Polarity" = "极性";
"Trim" = "微调";
"Delay" = "延时";
"Reversed" = "相反";
"Same" = "相同";
"* The subwoofer's level from 30 to 80 Hz, against the speakers' from 500 Hz to 2 kHz. Its distance includes the delay of its low-pass filter." = "* 超低音的音量取 30–80 Hz，音箱取 500 Hz–2 kHz 来比较。超低音的距离包含其低通滤波器带来的延迟。";
"%@ has opposite polarity" = "%@极性相反";
"%@: no timing click heard" = "%@：没听到测时短音";
"%@ is %.1f dB louder than the others" = "%@比其他音箱响 %.1f dB";
"%@ is %.1f dB quieter than the others" = "%@比其他音箱轻 %.1f dB";
"%@ is %.1f m farther than the others" = "%@比其他音箱远 %.1f 米";
"%@ is %.1f m nearer than the others" = "%@比其他音箱近 %.1f 米";
"Subwoofer %+.1f dB against the speakers" = "超低音比音箱 %+.1f dB";
"It moves out while the front left moves in, which thins the sound between them. Check its cable (+ and − swapped) and the receiver's settings, then measure again." = "前左振膜向内收时它在向外推，两者之间的声音会变薄。检查它的音箱线（+、− 是否接反）和功放设置，然后重新测量。";
"It may not play at all, or play from another channel. Run the wiring check, then measure again." = "它可能根本没出声，或者是从别的声道出声。先做一次接线检查，然后重新测量。";
"Tapline trims it, but a difference this large is worth fixing with the receiver's channel level or the speaker's own level control." = "Tapline 会把它调平，但差这么多，最好用功放的声道电平或音箱自己的音量旋钮先调好。";
"Tapline delays the nearer speakers to match. Check the speaker's placement, and that the microphone heard this speaker and not a reflection." = "Tapline 会让较近的音箱延时来对齐。请检查这只音箱的摆位，以及麦克风听到的确实是它本身而不是反射声。";
"Its level is a matter of taste: set it with the subwoofer's gain or the receiver's subwoofer level, where most people like it a few dB above the speakers. Through a receiver the LFE channel also plays 10 dB hotter by design." = "超低音多响全凭喜好：用它自己的增益旋钮或功放的超低音电平来调，多数人喜欢比音箱高几 dB。经过功放时，LFE 声道按规范本来就会高 10 dB。";
"5. Correct" = "5. 校正";
"Each speaker gets its own room correction, after the EQ and effects. Cuts room resonances first; dips are only lifted a little." = "每只音箱都有自己的房间校正，作用在 EQ 和效果之后。优先削减房间共振；凹陷只会补一点点。";
"Trim %@ · delay %.2f ms" = "微调 %@ · 延时 %.2f ms";
"The subwoofer is corrected below 120 Hz and never boosted above it." = "超低音只在 120 Hz 以下校正，120 Hz 以上从不提升。";
"Measure at least once to see each speaker's response here." = "至少测量一次，这里才会显示每只音箱的频响。";
"Correct below (front)" = "校正上限（前置）";
"Correct below (surround, height)" = "校正上限（环绕、顶部）";
"Defaults" = "默认值";
"500 Hz for the front speakers, 300 Hz for surrounds and heights" = "前置音箱 500 Hz，环绕和顶部音箱 300 Hz";
"Align levels and delays" = "对齐音量和延时";
"Apply each speaker's trim and delay with its correction" = "应用校正时一并应用每只音箱的音量微调和延时";
"Copied, with a Channel section per speaker for Equalizer APO." = "已复制，每只音箱一段 Equalizer APO 的 Channel 设置。";
"Speaker correction" = "音箱校正";
"Switches every speaker's correction, trim and delay on or off" = "一并开关每只音箱的校正、音量微调和延时";
"Applied to %@: every speaker's filters, trim and delay. Measurements bypass Tapline, so measuring again still shows the room without them." = "已应用到 %@：每只音箱的滤波器、音量微调和延时。测量信号不经过 Tapline，所以再测量看到的仍是未校正的房间。";

/* Multichannel speakers: Effects page, Listen As */
"%@ is a %@ speaker layout. Tapline processes each of its %lld speakers." = "%@ 是 %@ 音箱布局。Tapline 会分别处理它的 %lld 只音箱。";
"Play the EQ on every speaker" = "EQ 作用于每只音箱";
"Off: the EQ plays on the front left and right only. On the subwoofer (LFE) channel it never boosts above 120 Hz." = "关闭时，EQ 只作用于前左和前右。在超低音（LFE）声道上，EQ 从不提升 120 Hz 以上。";
"Each speaker's room correction, trim and delay from the Room page." = "来自“房间校正”页的每只音箱的校正、音量微调和延时。";
"Measure the speakers on the Room page to correct each one." = "在“房间校正”页测量音箱后，即可逐只校正。";
"Balance, width, mono and swap act on the front left and right speakers. Crossfeed, Virtual Speakers and Listen As are for headphones and stay off on this output." = "声道平衡、立体声宽度、单声道和左右声道互换只作用于前左和前右音箱。耳机交叉馈送、虚拟音箱和模拟试听是给耳机用的，在这个输出上保持关闭。";
"Listen As imitates a stereo device, so it stays off on this %@ speaker layout." = "模拟试听模仿的是立体声设备，所以在这套 %@ 音箱布局上保持关闭。";
